<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51106" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vīrōsus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		virus. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Full of</i> or <i>covered with
			slime</i>, <i>slimy</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">loci,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 257, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pisces,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cels.
					2, 21</span></i>
			.— <i>Sup.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">medicamentum adversus stomachum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Scrib. Comp. 103</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Having a bad odor</i>, <i>stinking</i>, <i>fetid</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">virosi odoris sordes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Scrib. Comp. 163</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">castorea,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 1, 58</span></i>
			: <i><span class="en">Nemes. Cyneg. 223</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">eluvies,</span>”
				i. e. <i>urine</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Grat. Cyn. 355</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>Poisonous.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spinae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. M. 7, p. 196</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 4, § 332</span></i>.
			—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, <i>foul</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aures mariti virosa susurronum faece completae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sid. Ep. 5, 7 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
